---
// Hero: two-line headline, app download CTAs, and the browse footnote.
---

<section class="hero">
  <h1 class="hero-title reveal">
    Everything you need,<br class="hero-br" /> delivered across Malawi.
  </h1>
  <p class="hero-copy reveal" style="--reveal-delay: 70ms">
    From phones and fashion to groceries and home goods, shop trusted sellers and
    pay with Airtel Money, TNM Mpamba or card.
  </p>

  <div class="hero-actions reveal" style="--reveal-delay: 140ms">
    <a class="btn btn-solid" href="#">
      <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="18" height="18" aria-hidden="true" fill="none" stroke="#fff" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round">
        <path d="M12 4.5v9" />
        <path d="M8.6 10.1 12 13.5l3.4-3.4" />
        <path d="M5 16.5v1.5c0 .8.7 1.5 1.5 1.5h11c.8 0 1.5-.7 1.5-1.5v-1.5" />
      </svg>
      Download the app
    </a>
  </div>

  <!-- One download button for now; the stores open with the launch. -->
  <p class="store-note reveal" style="--reveal-delay: 200ms">Google Play and the App Store are coming soon</p>

  <p class="hero-footnote reveal" style="--reveal-delay: 240ms">
    <a class="footnote-link" href="#categories">Browse on the website</a>
  </p>
</section>

<style>
  .hero {
    max-width: 780px;
    margin: 0 auto;
    padding: clamp(2.5rem, 7vw, 5rem) 0 clamp(2.75rem, 7vw, 4.5rem);
    text-align: center;
  }

  .hero-title {
    font-size: clamp(42px, 5.5vw, 64px);
    font-weight: 700;
    line-height: 1.08;
  }

  .hero-copy {
    max-width: 620px;
    margin: 1.25rem auto 0;
    font-size: 1.0625rem;
    color: var(--body);
  }

  .hero-actions {
    display: flex;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    justify-content: center;
    gap: 0.75rem;
    margin-top: 2rem;
  }

  /* Store availability note under the single download button. */
  .store-note {
    margin-top: 1rem;
    font-size: 0.8125rem;
    color: var(--body);
  }

  .hero-footnote {
    margin-top: 1rem;
    font-size: 0.8125rem;
    color: var(--body);
  }

  .footnote-link {
    color: var(--navy);
    text-decoration: underline;
    text-underline-offset: 2px;
  }

  .footnote-link:hover {
    color: var(--navy-hover);
  }

  .footnote-sep {
    margin: 0 0.4em;
  }

  /* Below ~660px the forced break no longer fits two 42px lines, so the
     headline wraps naturally instead. */
  @media (max-width: 659px) {
    .hero-br {
      display: none;
    }
  }
</style>
